# Process Charter: IT Problem Management

## 1. Process Objective
Analyze the root cause of recurring or major incidents (P1/P2) and design permanent fixes (Known Error Database) to prevent incident recurrence.

## 2. Process Workflow
```text
[ Major/Repeated Incident ] ──> [ RCA Investigation (5-Whys / Fishbone) ]
                                          │
                                          ▼
[ Workaround / Known Error Logged ] ──> [ Permanent Fix via Change Request (CR) ]
